# Placeholder — replace with the real Sigstore/Cosign public key before
# the first official module is signed and released via modulab-modules.
#
# Generate a key pair:
#   cosign generate-key-pair
# This produces cosign.key (private, keep secret) and cosign.pub (public).
# Copy the contents of cosign.pub here, removing this comment block.
#
# Sign a release asset:
#   cosign sign-blob --key cosign.key module.zip > module.zip.sig
#
# The verifier (verifier.go) embeds this file at build time and writes it
# to a temp file when verifying official module signatures. As long as this
# file contains only a comment (no "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----" header),
# Core will refuse to verify official module signatures and log a warning.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
